BT /F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 675.0 Tm (1. Overview) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 657.0 Tm (The agent is designed as a controlled autonomous workflow for HR operations. It interprets) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 644.0 Tm (goals in business terms first, prepares the target environment, inspects relevant) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 631.0 Tm (application logic, executes the smallest safe action, verifies the outcome, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 618.0 Tm (continuously improves through recorded memory and reflection.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 599.0 Tm (2. Key Features) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 581.0 Tm (- Business-operation-first interpretation of user goals.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 566.0 Tm (- Warm-start behavior that reuses known context before broad discovery.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 551.0 Tm (- Mandatory reasoning and action justification before mutation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 536.0 Tm (- Targeted system inspection to support safe execution.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 521.0 Tm (- Bounded retry behavior with explicit recovery logic.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 506.0 Tm (- Persistent memory, logs, and post-run reflection.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 485.0 Tm (3. Design Goals) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 467.0 Tm (- Make HR outcomes the primary decision lens before treating a request as an) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 454.0 Tm (  engineering task.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 439.0 Tm (- Start quickly by using configured startup data and warm context by default.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 424.0 Tm (- Prefer narrow, reversible operations with verification after every meaningful step.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 409.0 Tm (- Escalate rather than guess when confidence or evidence is insufficient.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 394.0 Tm (- Retain lessons across runs so later execution becomes safer and faster.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 373.0 Tm (4. Core Operating Principles) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 355.0 Tm (- Summary-only inspection output during normal operation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 340.0 Tm (- Targeted discovery before broad rediscovery.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 325.0 Tm (- Read-first validation before write actions when possible.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 310.0 Tm (- Reflection after every completed or terminally failed run.) Tj ET
