BT /F3 8.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 301.0 Tm (                    defaults, and safety settings.) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 290.0 Tm (Reasoning Agent     Interprets intent and produces the safest execution) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 279.0 Tm (                    path.) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 268.0 Tm (Discovery Agent     Refreshes only the technical facts needed for the) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 257.0 Tm (                    active goal.) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 246.0 Tm (Execution Agent     Performs one justified action at a time and verifies) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 235.0 Tm (                    the outcome.) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 224.0 Tm (Recovery Agent      Diagnoses failures, applies narrow corrections, and) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 213.0 Tm (                    retries only when justified.) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 202.0 Tm (Reflection Agent    Evaluates results and improves future heuristics.) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 191.0 Tm (State & Memory      Stores workflow progress, history, and operational) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 180.0 Tm (                    evidence.) Tj ET
