BT /F3 8.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 646.0 Tm (------------------------  ----------------------------------------------------) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 635.0 Tm (Entry Command             agent run "<goal>") Tj ET
BT /F3 8.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 624.0 Tm (Default Persona           hr operations specialist) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 613.0 Tm (Goal Interpretation       business-operation-first) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 602.0 Tm (Startup Mode              configured-path warm-start) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 591.0 Tm (Runtime Shell             powershell) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 580.0 Tm (Warm Cache Reuse          enabled when the active target still matches) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 569.0 Tm (Discovery Preference      targeted refresh before any broad rediscovery) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 558.0 Tm (Authentication            required before task execution) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 547.0 Tm (Retry Limit               3) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 536.0 Tm (Safe Mode                 enabled) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 525.0 Tm (Bulk Operations           disabled unless reasoning marks them explicitly safe) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 514.0 Tm (CLI Visibility            summary-only during inspection) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 503.0 Tm (Action Reasoning          required before every execution step) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 492.0 Tm (Memory Update             after each task and major state transition) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 481.0 Tm (Reflection                required after completion or terminal failure) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 464.0 Tm (11. Risk and Recovery Guardrails) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 446.0 Tm (- Prefer read-only verification before any write action.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 431.0 Tm (- Avoid broad or bulk changes unless the reasoning step explicitly justifies them.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 416.0 Tm (- Retry only when the failure is plausibly recoverable and something meaningful) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 403.0 Tm (  changes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 388.0 Tm (- Escalate when evidence is conflicting, destructive side effects appear, or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 375.0 Tm (  confidence remains too low.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 354.0 Tm (12. Completion Guarantees) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 336.0 Tm (- A run ends only after it reaches a terminal outcome such as completed, failed, or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 323.0 Tm (  escalated.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 308.0 Tm (- Execution history, failure records, state tracking, task memory, and reflection must) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 295.0 Tm (  all be updated.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 280.0 Tm (- Recorded lessons are expected to influence later runs so the system becomes safer) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 267.0 Tm (  and more consistent over time.) Tj ET
